Whenever you use a disfigured face power you show a glimpse of what True Horror is.

If the affected targets fail a spell save they become frightened for 2 turns, giving them a [18%, 24%, 29%, 33%, 37% (TL1-5; SP 100)] chances to fail using talents.

When a target becomes afraid it bolsters you to see their anguish, increasing your darkness and blight damage penetration by [24%, 33%, 40%, 45%, 50% (TL1-5; SP 100)] for 2 turns.

The values will increase with your Spellpower.
